MIT covers this package's own code. It does not cover the runtime in `assets/`: those are third-party
builds with their own terms. The Kotlin compiler and Kotlin/Wasm standard library are Apache-2.0; the
GraalVM Web Image runtime carries Oracle GraalVM terms and includes GPLv2 + Classpath Exception code.
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists them and records the redistribution caveat.
